#: include/classes/data/CItemData.php:1165
msgid ""
"Checks if file exists. Returns 0 - not found; 1 - file of the specified type"
" exists"
msgstr "檢查檔案是否存在。傳回 0 - 找不到；1 - 指定類型的檔案存在"

