"ping successful."
msgstr "透過 ICMP ping 檢查主機是否可連線。0 - ICMP ping 失敗。1 - ICMP ping 成功。"

#: include/classes/data/CItemData.php:953
msgid ""
"Checks if it is possible to make TCP connection to specified port. Returns 0"
" - cannot connect; 1 - can connect"
msgstr "檢查是否可與指定連接埠建立 TCP 連線。傳回 0 - 無法連線；1 - 可以連線"

#: include/classes/data/CItemData.php:961
msgid ""
"Checks if service is running and accepting TCP connections. Returns 0 - "
"service is down; 1 - service is running"
msgstr "檢查服務是否正在執行並接受 TCP 連線。傳回 0 - 服務無法使用；1 - 服務正在執行"

#: include/classes/data/CItemData.php:977
