"Checks if service is running and responding to UDP requests. Returns 0 - "
"service is down; 1 - service is running"
msgstr "檢查服務是否正在執行並回應 UDP 請求。傳回 0 - 服務無法使用；1 - 服務正在執行"

#: include/classes/data/CItemData.php:949
msgid ""
"Checks if this TCP port is in LISTEN state. Returns 0 - it is not in LISTEN "
"state; 1 - it is in LISTEN state"
msgstr "檢查此 TCP 連接埠是否處於 LISTEN 狀態。傳回 0 - 非 LISTEN 狀態；1 - LISTEN 狀態"

#: include/classes/data/CItemData.php:969
msgid ""
"Checks if this UDP port is in LISTEN state. Returns 0 - it is not in LISTEN "
"state; 1 - it is in LISTEN state"
msgstr "檢查此 UDP 連接埠是否處於 LISTEN 狀態。傳回 0 - 非 LISTEN 狀態；1 - LISTEN 狀態"

#: include/classes/data/CItemData.php:957
msgid ""
"Checks performance of TCP service. Returns 0 - service is down; seconds - "
"the number of seconds spent while connecting to the service"
msgstr "檢查 TCP 服務效能。傳回 0 - 服務無法使用；秒數 - 建立服務連線所花費的秒數"

#: include/classes/data/CItemData.php:973
msgid ""
"Checks performance of UDP service. Returns 0 - service is down; seconds - "
"the number of seconds spent waiting for response from the service"
msgstr "檢查 UDP 服務效能。傳回 0 - 服務無法使用；秒數 - 等待服務回應所花費的秒數"

